      "subject": "החפשות",
      "rationale": "Kiugo gĩkĩ gĩtuĩka gĩa thĩinĩ wa Tanakh gĩkĩga tu harĩ-inĩ; kĩgoro kĩayo kĩrarĩirie — 'nyumba ya kũikarerwo' nĩ kwĩrigĩrĩria kũigua kwayo."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "החפשות",
      "rationale": "Atũri mari mbere: 'nyumba ya kũikarerwo' (ya mũrarua gĩthingo-inĩ) handũ ha 'nyumba ya mahiũri' kana 'nyumba ya kũhonokĩa' — maũndũ mothe nĩ magĩtie mwandĩkĩre wa Kĩhibirania."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "מצרע … מצרע",
      "rationale": "Kiugo gĩa 'gũtarua' kĩrarĩkiririo gerĩa mbere na gĩa gĩa keerĩ thutha wa החפשות — kĩhumĩrĩro kĩrĩa gĩtatũkĩte Gĩkũyũ-inĩ."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Nĩ ũgũ Uziahu mũthamaki nĩatuĩkite mũrarua nginya mũthenya wa gũkua kwake, na akĩikara nyumbainĩ ya kũikarerwo ⟨arĩ mũrarua⟩, nĩgũkorwo nĩagatuanĩtwo na nyumba ya Yahwe; na Yothamu mũrũ wake nĩwe warĩ igũrũ rĩa nyumba ya mũthamaki, arĩkĩria ciira cia ⟨את⟩ andũ a thĩ.",
